est?cb=20070704173229&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Troll_Green_aa65cc.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a troll green.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Troll</a> Greens are a rare class of herbs, which tastes similar to basil. They can be found in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dusalk%27s%20Troll%20Clan%20Cave\">Dusalk's Troll Clan Cave</a> located in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Green Claw Swamp</a> and in the northeastern part of the main <a href=\"#/wiki/Necromancer\">Necromancer</a> cave in <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a>. It is located near the <a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Sheep\">Black Sheep</a>. You can see one in <a href=\"#/wiki/Meriana\">Meriana</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Chondur\">Chondur</a>'s house. They can also be seen in quite a large quantity around the <a href=\"#/wiki/Paradox%20Tower\">Paradox Tower</a>.\n</p>\n<p>2 of them are needed for the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Vixen\">Black Vixen</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Darkfang\">Darkfang</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hemming\">Hemming</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sharpclaw\">Sharpclaw</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Swamp%20Troll\">Swamp Troll</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Werebadger\">Werebadger</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Werefox\">Werefox</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Werewolf\">Werewolf</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div